        ],
        "notes": "begin_checkout is deliberately NOT in this list. The existing GA4 - Checkout tag already fires on it via trigger 100 (see GTM-5ZBFGDCB_begin_checkout.json), and matching it here too would put two GA4 events on one checkout. To get the configuration context onto checkout, add the olto_* params to GA4 - Checkout rather than adding the event back here."
